        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leonarda Cianciulli\n- Works: Black Journal\n- Places: Correggio, Italy\n- Topics: Serial killers, murder cases\n\nFacts:\n- Leonarda Cianciulli was born on 14 November 1893 and died on 15 October 1970.\n- Leonarda Cianciulli was an Italian serial killer.\n- Between 1939 and 1940, Leonarda Cianciulli murdered three women in Correggio.\n- Leonarda Cianciulli was known as the \"Soap-Maker of Correggio\" and turned the bodies of her victims into soap and teacakes.\n- Black Journal is based on the real-life events of Leonarda Cianciulli.",
